<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="updated">CRIPFCnt · Last updated 3 August 2026</div>

  <p>CRIPFCnt ("we", "us", "our") is an educational service that lets parents, teachers and
  students take quizzes, track learning progress, and complete the 8 Quotients Test. This policy
  explains what we collect, why, and the choices you have. It applies to the CRIPFCnt mobile app
  and the website at cripfcnt.com.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Account information</strong> - the name you provide and, if you add one, an email
    address. These identify your account and let you sign in across devices.</li>
    <li><strong>Learner information</strong> - for children a parent or teacher adds, we store the
    child's name, grade, a generated username, and their quiz activity (attempts, scores, progress,
    and knowledge-map data). This is used to show learning progress to the responsible parent or
    teacher.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage and device information</strong> - basic technical information needed to run
    the service reliably, such as app version and sync status.</li>
    <li><strong>Payment information</strong> - subscription payments are processed by our payment
    provider (Paynow / EcoCash). We receive confirmation of whether a payment succeeded; we do not
    collect or store your mobile-money PIN or full payment credentials.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To provide the core features: accounts, quizzes, progress tracking and the knowledge map.</li>
    <li>To let a parent or teacher manage and view their learners' activity.</li>
    <li>To enable sign-in on a learner's own device using credentials set by their parent or teacher.</li>
    <li>To operate, secure, and improve the service, and to provide support.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Children's data</h2>
  <p>CRIPFCnt is designed to be set up and managed by a responsible adult (a parent or teacher).
  Learner profiles are created by that adult, who controls the child's account and can update or
  remove it. We collect only the information needed to deliver quizzes and show progress, and we do
  not use children's information for advertising.</p>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share information only with service providers who
  help us operate CRIPFCnt (for example, hosting and payment processing), and only as needed to
  provide the service, or where required by law.</p>

  <h2>Data retention</h2>
  <p>We keep account and learner information for as long as the account is active. You may request
  deletion of your account and associated data at any time using the contact details below, after
  which we remove it except where we are required to retain limited records by law.</p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>We use industry-standard measures, including encrypted connections (HTTPS) and secure storage
  of credentials, to protect information. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure,
  but we work to protect your data.</p>

  <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Access, correct, or delete your account information.</li>
    <li>Remove a learner profile you manage.</li>
    <li>Request a copy of the data associated with your account.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To exercise any of these, contact us using the details below.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by updating the
  "Last updated" date at the top of this page.</p>

  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <div class="box">
    <p style="margin:0">CRIPFCnt<br/>
    Email: <a href="mailto:support@cripfcnt.com">support@cripfcnt.com</a><br/>
    Website: <a href="https://cripfcnt.com">https://cripfcnt.com</a></p>
  </div>

  <footer>© 2026 CRIPFCnt. All rights reserved.</footer>
</div>
